>> title: Russian Tea Cakes
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: walnuts, butter, powdered sugar, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery, Panadería
>> aka: Mexican wedding cookies, Mexican wedding cakes, polvorones, snowball cookies, butterballs
>> servings: 48
>> time: 40 min

Heat the #oven{} to 400°F (205°C) and line two #baking sheets{} with parchment.

>> step: cream
Cream @unsalted butter{1%cup}(226 g; softened) with @powdered sugar{1/2%cup}(60 g) and @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2 1/4%cup}(280 g) and @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g).

Stir @&(~1)dry ingredients{} into @&(~2)creamed butter{}.

Stir @finely chopped walnuts{3/4%cup}(85 g) into @&(~1)dough{}.

Roll @&(~1)dough{} into 1-in balls and bake at 400°F for ~{11%min}.

>> step: roll in powdered sugar while warm
Roll @&(~1)warm cookies{} in @powdered sugar{1/2%cup}(60 g).
